<body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px;">With</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span><span style="margin: 0px;">exercises</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> like </span><span style="margin: 0px;">the</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> </span></span><a href="https://td-academy.org/en/updates/video-en-webinar-on-developing-theories-of-change-in-inter-and-transdisciplinary-contexts/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px;"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; text-decoration-line: underline; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><span style="margin: 0px">Theory of Change</span></span></a><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">you</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">capture</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">the</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">diversity</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">within</span><span style="margin: 0px"> a </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> team.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">This</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">exercise</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is </span><span style="margin: 0px">used</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in co-</span><span style="margin: 0px">creation</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">processes</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">create</span><span style="margin: 0px"> a </span><span style="margin: 0px">clear</span><span style="margin: 0px"> mission plan, </span><span style="margin: 0px">align</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">perspectives</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">uncover</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">hidden</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">misunderstandings</span><span style="margin: 0px">, </span><span style="margin: 0px">and</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">analyze</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">how</span><span style="margin: 0px"> long-term goals </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">be</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">achieved</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Truly understanding</span><span style="margin: 0px"> each other and developing a shared language requires </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">ongoing reflection</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">That may sound heavy, but it </span><span style="margin: 0px">essentially means</span><span style="margin: 0px"> never forgetting to </span><span style="margin: 0px">ask</span><span style="margin: 0px"> questions about everything you say and </span><span style="margin: 0px">hear</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Do I </span><span style="margin: 0px">understand</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">this</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">correctly</span><span style="margin: 0px">? </span><span style="margin: 0px">And</span><span style="margin: 0px">: do </span><span style="margin: 0px">others</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">understand</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">what</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">I’m</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">trying</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">to</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">communicate</span><span style="margin: 0px">?</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Feeling free and safe to speak up within the team is again essential in this regard.</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">Only</span><span style="margin: 0px"> in </span><span style="margin: 0px">this</span><span style="margin: 0px"> way </span><span style="margin: 0px">can</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">disciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">boundaries</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">be</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">crossed</span><span style="margin: 0px"> and </span><span style="margin: 0px">transdisciplinary</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">knowledge</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">emerge</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></body>
